WEBVTT

00:00:20.465 --> 00:00:23.465
A woman in a black tee and gold necklaces speaks to camera, raising both hands then lowering them, seated before a desk, ring light and collage-filled TV screen.

00:00:42.195 --> 00:00:45.195
She gestures with one hand near her chest, then rests both hands down, smiling briefly before raising a hand again as she keeps talking.

00:01:04.074 --> 00:01:07.074
She extends one arm out to the side, lowers it, then leans toward the camera, raising both hands in front of her chest while speaking.

00:01:26.508 --> 00:01:29.508
Small text below reads "the FYP, Search, Following tab, STEM tab, Lives, etc." The slide changes to "TikTok has stated:" with highlighted quote and inset clip of TikTok's CEO.

00:01:49.684 --> 00:01:52.684
Both hands gesture low in front of her, then settle briefly before she lifts one hand toward her chest, the collage-filled monitor glowing behind her.

00:02:16.104 --> 00:02:19.104
A slide headed "THE 'FYP'" holds on a TikTok newsroom article with highlighted lines, then cuts back to the presenter gesturing before the collage monitor.

00:02:38.193 --> 00:02:41.193
A static slide titled "THE 'FYP' EXPLAINED" holds: Step 1's person-and-charts icon, an arrow, then Step 2's stacked video-player icons, each with caption text beneath.

00:02:58.553 --> 00:03:01.553
A slide listing "3 ways TikTok determines a user's interests" shows a "Choose your interests" tag screen, then adds point 2 beside a settings menu with "Language" outlined green.

00:03:24.048 --> 00:03:27.048
Back at her desk, the woman in a black tee speaks toward the camera, leaning forward and lifting both hands, palms up, before the collage-filled screen.

00:03:48.628 --> 00:03:51.628
The slide holds still on all three listed points, then a hand-drawn black oval loops around item 3, "The users interactions (and non-actions) with the app."

00:04:09.477 --> 00:04:12.477
A slide headed "'Insterest Signals'" holds an empty white rounded box; after a pause, the first bullet appears inside it: "Watching or skipping a video."

00:04:31.204 --> 00:04:34.204
The completed three-column bullet list holds still, then the slide cuts to the presenter at her white desk, gesturing, a collage-filled screen behind her.

00:04:58.296 --> 00:05:01.296
A new slide titled "The 'FYP' Explained" stays onscreen: Step 1's person-and-charts icon, an arrow, then Step 2's stack of three video players, with captions beneath.

00:05:22.035 --> 00:05:25.035
A phone mockup plays a TikTok of someone stretching on a floor beside the bulleted list, then the shot cuts to the presenter, fingertips pressed together.

00:05:44.837 --> 00:05:47.837
Seated before a monitor displaying a photo collage, the presenter gestures with both hands, lowers them, then lifts one again; a camera on a tripod and lamps flank her.

00:06:10.001 --> 00:06:13.001
She raises both hands near her chest, fingers spread, then lowers them out of frame, settling upright in the white room facing the camera.

00:06:36.884 --> 00:06:39.884
Sitting still at first, she then leans toward the camera, bringing both hands up with fingers pinched near her chest, the collage screen blurring behind her.

00:07:29.231 --> 00:07:32.231
A static slide titled "TIKTOK SEARCH" fills the screen, showing three phone screenshots — one labelled 'Search', two grouped under 'Recommended Search' with circled search prompts highlighted.

00:07:53.208 --> 00:07:56.208
Beside the phone displaying TikTok food search results, a new heading appears: "Relevance and Content Information," with a bullet about video captions, video text, and hashtags matching the inquiry.

00:08:13.287 --> 00:08:16.287
The slide remains static: "Engagement" and "User interactions" now sit below the first heading, with a bullet reading "Your past search behavior/content you've liked."

00:08:34.625 --> 00:08:37.625
Back at her desk, the woman gestures with an open palm, lowers her hands, then raises the palm again while speaking toward the camera; collage-filled monitor behind her.

00:09:01.544 --> 00:09:04.544
The slide holds still: a phone screenshot of TikTok food search results on the left, beside a bullet reading "Relevance and Content Information" above a

00:09:22.932 --> 00:09:25.932
Facing the camera in her white-walled studio, the woman holds both hands up near her chest, fingers pinched, then lowers and shifts them as she keeps talking.

00:09:57.357 --> 00:10:00.357
She thrusts one hand toward the camera, then drops the arm and turns her head aside before facing forward again, hands settling near her lap.

00:10:22.927 --> 00:10:25.927
A dark teal slide with faint binary digits replaces her: "When you think like the algorithm... You can better predict which videos will engage well with your audience."

00:10:44.296 --> 00:10:47.296
A new slide holds still: bold heading beside a numbered bullet, with a pale left panel showing a blank search bar and floating question marks.

00:11:05.683 --> 00:11:08.683
A phone mockup displays a TikTok plant-shop video labelled "low light plants"; a fourth bullet appears: "Use that phrase throughout your video: talking, text, caption, hashtags."

00:11:29.977 --> 00:11:32.977
A static slide reads "How to work with the algorithm to show up on the FYP:" above one bullet; left panel shows a figure icon with arrows toward question marks.

00:12:15.035 --> 00:12:18.035
The slide now lists all four numbered bullets; the phone mockup plays a TikTok of a woman in a pink sweater adjusting her hair indoors.

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:42.650
The woman in a black tee returns onscreen at her white desk, gesturing with one hand, then lowering it before raising both fists near her shoulders.

00:13:04.794 --> 00:13:07.794
Seated at her white desk, she holds a reddish object, then opens both hands wide apart before bringing one palm toward her chest while talking to camera.

00:13:25.632 --> 00:13:28.632
She tugs at her shirt hem, drops both arms out of frame, then lifts her hands back up, palms turned inward, continuing to speak toward the camera.

00:14:28.719 --> 00:14:31.719
She presses her fingertips together, lowers her gaze with hands clasped, then lifts one hand beside her face and the other toward her chest.

00:14:53.807 --> 00:14:56.807
She raises both index fingers upward, lowers her hands out of frame, then lifts both open hands beside her face with fingers spread.

